# Daily book replenishment

Job: `php scripts/run_daily_book_replenishment.php` (schedule ~1:00 AM). Processes **yesterday’s** book sales from `vp_orders`.

Period sales: `NumsoldReplenishment::getForProduct()` (`numsold_replenishment`). Stub uses local lookback until the Exotic API is wired in `fetchFromExoticApi()`.

If `(physical stock + pending PO qty) < purchase_threshold_percent of numsold_replenishment`, set `vp_products.replenishment_buy_qty` to `min_stock_percent of numsold_replenishment` and upsert `vp_replenishment_buy_report` (purchased yes/no).

Report: `?page=replenishment_buy_report&action=list`
